    {
      "content": "`lake exe lint-style --fix` strips trailing whitespace, but a whitespace-only line INSIDE a Lean command then becomes a truly empty line, which Mathlib's linter.style.emptyLine flags ('do not place empty lines within commands'). The whitespace had been hiding those lines from that linter. Under --wfail this turns a green build red (79 new warnings across 26 files in one repo). Fix: delete the emptied lines that warn, then re-anchor any file.lean:NNN citations, since line numbers shift. Budget a full rebuild after --fix before calling it done.",
